### 变量
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### =============================================
### 1. 登录 — 获取 JWT token
### POST /auth/login
### =============================================
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 登录失败：密码错误
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrong_password"
}

### 登录失败：用户名为空（Validation 校验）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### =============================================
### 2. 获取所有用户（需携带 token）
### GET /users
### =============================================
### 🔑 先执行上方登录请求，将返回的 token 替换到下方 @token 变量中

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取所有用户 — 未携带 token（应返回 401）
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Accept: application/json
